- v1.5.0: SessionStart hook, broadened skill descriptions, thread view, morning briefing, inbox check
- v1.6.0: Reliability & Diagnostics — structured error envelope, transient retry, multi-account doctor, health_check tool, troubleshooting guide
- v1.7.0: Attachment support (compose_email + send_email, MML format), 3 security fixes (flag injection, ICS escapes, Zod dep)
- v1.8.0: 3 new skills (forward, export, threads), 7 new workflows, adversarial audit (21 fixes), cheat sheet, split CLI/MCP tools, security deep-dive, contributing guide
- v1.8.1: 5 groff man pages, CLI modular refactor (5 modules), fixed bin script arg forwarding, fixed man page install
- **em Commands Porting (PR #76 → v1.9.0)**: Ported all flow-cli `em` commands to MCP tools/skills/prompts
  - Phase 1: `getTrashFolder()` utility, `get_unread_count`, `read_email_raw`, `render_email`, `list_starred`, count-sync test
  - Phase 2: `create_reminder` (Apple Reminders), `snooze_email`/`list_snoozed_emails` (JSON-backed), `weekly_email_digest` prompt, `triage_inbox` enhancement, `create_action_item` extension
  - Phase 3: `/email:respond` skill (batch draft-reply workflow)
  - Docs: Migration guide + tutorial, nav reorganization (task-grouped Tutorials, Guides/Operations split)
  - 7 new tools, 1 new prompt, 1 new skill
- **v1.9.0 Release (PR #77)**: dev→main merge, GitHub release v1.9.0 with .mcpb asset, Homebrew formula auto-pushed, marketplace auto-synced
- **v1.9.0 CI Fix (PR #78)**: Fixed reminders.test.ts failing on Linux CI (process.platform mocking)

